# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/
obj/
.vs/
*.user

# ── GAME LOGS — NEVER COMMIT THESE ───────────────────────────────────────────
# BepInEx's LogOutput.log contains the game's OWN TEXT, verbatim: the dialogue
# this mod reads aloud, character names, item and menu strings. That is Konami's
# copyrighted script, captured incidentally while testing, and it must not go
# into a public repository. The copy in this folder holds 27 lines of the
# Suikoden II opening plus several hundred UI strings.
#
# Logs are also how this project is debugged, so one will keep reappearing here.
# Ignore the whole class rather than a single filename.
*.log
LogOutput.log
out.txt
nav_out.txt

# ── Player data files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Written next to the plugin at runtime, in BepInEx\plugins, so they normally
# never appear here at all — but they get copied in for inspection. They are the
# player's own discoveries (names they typed, exits they walked, places they
# marked) and they are per-save and per-playthrough, so they are not project
# state. They are designed to be SHAREABLE: if a curated starter set is ever
# worth shipping, add it deliberately with `git add -f` under a different name
# such as `examples/`, rather than letting a working copy drift into the repo.
suikoden1_npc_names.txt
suikoden1_exits.txt
suikoden1_marks.txt
suikoden1_places.txt
suikoden1_npc_names.txt.old-autonamed
suikoden1_collision_dump.txt
suikoden2_npc_names.txt

# ── Diagnostic dumps written by the mod (both games) ─────────────────────────
# Written next to the plugin and copied out for analysis. They are built from the
# running game and some carry its OWN TEXT verbatim - the Suikoden II F4 dump
# (suikoden2_npcs_<map>.txt) writes every loaded text table, i.e. the script.
# They belong in the ground-truth folder outside this repo, never in it. The
# patterns are broad on purpose: a dump with a new name must not slip through.
suikoden1_*.txt
suikoden2_*.txt
suikoden2_*.txt.*

# ── Anything extracted from the game ─────────────────────────────────────────
# The decompiled interop assemblies (GSD1.cs, GSD2.cs and friends) are derived
# from the shipped game and belong nowhere near this repo. They live under the
# game folder, not here, but this is a backstop in case one is ever copied in
# for grepping. Same for any dumped assets.
_decompiled/
*.decompiled.cs
# The game folder and its parts, should one ever be copied or linked in here,
# and the ground-truth folder of dumps kept beside this repo.
BepInEx/
interop/
*_Data/
il2cpp_data/
StreamingAssets/
Suikoden-Access-groundtruth/
*.exe
*.pdb
GSD1.cs
GSD2.cs
GSDShare.cs
ShareUI.cs
FrameWork.cs
*.assets
*.bundle
*.dll

# ── Screenshots and local reference material ─────────────────────────────────
# Screenshots of the game or its install folder are the player's own reference,
# not project state, and a screenshot of the running game would be game content.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.bmp
